Representative in-place diff for the Claude live-run hardening.

The RUNNING change is applied at import time by experiments/ajar/claude_harness_patch.py
(monkeypatch), so the frozen axor-core examples/agentdojo files are NOT edited on disk.
This file shows the equivalent edits a maintainer would fold into the two harness files.
Tested network-free: results/test_harness_patch.json, results/test_patch_integration.json.

